sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Ofc as Officer
  participant UI as React UI
  participant API as Express API
  participant DB as MySQL
  Ofc->>UI: Fill arrest form, Save
  UI->>API: POST /api/arrests + Bearer token
  API->>API: verify JWT, check role
  alt token invalid
    API-->>UI: 401 Login required
  else role not allowed
    API-->>UI: 403 Not allowed
  else allowed
    API->>DB: INSERT INTO Arrest (parameterized)
    Note over DB: trigger trg_arrest_after_insert<br/>criminal = Arrested<br/>case = Under Investigation<br/>status change logged
    DB-->>API: insertId
    API-->>UI: 201 arrest_id
    UI->>API: GET /api/arrests
    API->>DB: SELECT joined rows
    DB-->>UI: refreshed list
    UI-->>Ofc: modal closes, new row shown
  end